  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The absolute difference of the coefficients of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>13</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given expansion is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>The&nbsp;general term in the binomial expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn></mrow></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>11</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>11</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now for coefficient&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>11</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>Now for coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>11</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>We need the absolute difference, we get it by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>11</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>11</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>924</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2640</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1716</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Hence the absolute difference&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
